      "gold_retention union→selected",
      "bridge_vs_comparison breakdown",
      "gold_set_size breakdown",
      "mean selected size ≈ 10"
    ],
    "why_not_query_decomposition_first": "Measured bottleneck is selection under a complete pool, not missing candidates.",
